{
  "_comment": "Shared expectations for the pure helpers of window-probe.ps1 and screenshot-log.ps1. Hand-written; test_window_probe.py checks them against an independent Python implementation, test_window_probe.ps1 and test_screenshot_log.ps1 run the PowerShell functions against them. Colours are COLORREF values (0x00BBGGRR) in decimal.",
